  "id": "classroom-environment",
  "term": "classroom environment",
  "definition": "Classroom environment is the set of instructional and social conditions students perceive in a class that can shape how they learn and regulate their work. In this source, it includes teaching practices such as task design, teacher support, and opportunities for autonomy, as well as support from teachers and peers.",
